                        <p><strong>Hours:</strong> Always open</p>
                        <p><strong>Access:</strong> Bus to Ginkaku-ji Temple, then walk</p>
                        <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Best visited in early evening when most tour groups have left</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
